  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>Stoneville Farmcraft City：</em></span></strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>Stoneville Farmcraft City 是一張從零開始創建的 terraformed（地形改造）地圖，其構建基於核心概念和多種巨型建築結構。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>它由多個區域組成，這些區域通過具有生物羣系特徵的元素相互連接又彼此分隔。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>各個區域特色鮮明，允許多名玩家同時探索而互不干擾。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>所有建築均已裝飾完畢並準備好供玩家使用，同時保留了空間以發揮個人創意。這是一張大型地圖，因此單人遊玩或雙人合作將帶來漫長的探索和開發體驗。</span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span>地圖：</span></strong></em></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>以下是 Stoneville Farmcraft City 中開發的建築結構。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>我們力求提供高細節度的呈現效果，無論是否啟用光影渲染。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_807b2a89-5365-4da7-b1d4-931c8f73c993.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0e6e7300-f67d-4b1e-b89b-ef12effde494.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f6f5dfd1-7392-46a2-b8f8-c7866bf879d7.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_09bf9aa8-6dfb-4676-af18-32674bbee4e5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3d2493d5-7954-4a46-9b63-d9d145ad05bc.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b88087cd-8035-456d-930d-1506f2a6a029.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_37d5e337-30d3-4bfa-9b0f-6b114115fd98.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7a9531f3-0324-4398-9c0e-b47ec865b663.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cb9db9fe-b240-48d0-a150-8d531357039e.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\">更新說明：</span></span></em></strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>在開放項目完成之前，不會發布任何更新。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>歡迎在評論區提出任何想法，以供未來更新改進參考。</span></p>",
